description=Hardware-level kernel and subsystem optimizer for Samsung Galaxy devices. Developed by Kiran_embedded (https://github.com/kiran-embedded). Features LZ4 ZRAM with single-page decompression, UFS hardware I/O acceleration, touch governor calibration, and display refresh synchronization.
